<title>HUNGARY: Pannonplast IAS H1 net income HUF 910 mln.</title>
<headline>Pannonplast IAS H1 net income HUF 910 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-June 1997  Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 701     vs	570</p>
<p>    Earnings before taxes	1,112     vs	804</p>
<p>    Net income			 910     vs	668</p>
<p>    Sales			    6,556     vs    4,177</p>
<p>    Costs of sales		 4,388     vs    2,598</p>
<p>    Gross margin		   2,168     vs    1,579</p>
<p>    Interest income		  412 profit  vs    11 profit</p>
<p>    Income tax			 143     vs	102</p>
<p>    Investments,minorities	  59     vs	 34</p>
<p>NOTE - Pannonplast Muanyagipari Rt is a plastics industrial group. The figures are consolidated, were calculated in harmony with International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
